+\centering
+\includegraphics[width=\textwidth]{paper/figures/corrected/corrected_candidate_datapath.pdf}
+\caption{Corrected-candidate datapath on the inherited five-phase token
+schedule. Gray denotes inherited control and scheduling, orange denotes native
