+# Report Evidence Status
+
+Current release state: **NOT PAPER READY**.
+
+Reports produced before the corrected recurrence, recurrence-core boundary, and
+encoded arithmetic contract are preserved as legacy evidence. A historical
+file saying `PASS`, including `phase7_validation.md`, does not validate the
+current design or permit paper release.
+
+Current claims must point to an individually hash-bound artifact under a
+`corrected/` subtree or to another path explicitly promoted by
+`docs/evidence_manifest.md`. The authoritative release decision is
+`reports/final_completion_gate.json`; every one of its eleven rows must be
+`PASS` before a final paper PDF or submission archive may be generated.
+
+See `docs/implementation_status.md` and `reports/known_issues.md` for the exact
+completed, failed, unrun, and externally blocked evidence.
